@page "/grid-row"

<PageTitle>Grid row - GDS Components Demo</PageTitle>

<GdsBackLink Href="/" />

<GdsHeading Level="1">Grid row</GdsHeading>

<p class="govuk-body">
    The grid row layout component allows the users to create a row in the GOV.UK grid system, which can be used to structure content into columns.
</p>

<GdsHeading Level="2">Example</GdsHeading>
<div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 10px;">
    <GdsGridRow>
        <GdsGridColumn Width="GdsGridColumnWidth.TwoThirds">
            <GdsHeading Level="3" Size="GdsSize.ExtraLarge">Two-thirds column</GdsHeading>
            <p class="govuk-body">This is a paragraph inside a two-thirds wide column</p>
        </GdsGridColumn>
        <GdsGridColumn Width="GdsGridColumnWidth.OneThird">
            <GdsHeading Level="3" Size="GdsSize.Medium">One-third column</GdsHeading>
            <p class="govuk-body">This is a paragraph inside a one-third wide column</p>
        </GdsGridColumn>
    </GdsGridRow>
</div>

<p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-top-6">
    <strong>Note:</strong> The grid row layout in this demo page is shown within a border for demonstration purposes. 
</p>
